      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "Fall Launch Leak",
      "questDescription": "ByteSystems detected unusual outbound traffic before its fall product launch, but the affected data and scope are not yet confirmed. Help Piotr prioritize evidence-led triage, recover six captured evidence fragments, choose proportionate containment, and route an extortion demand through the authorized response process.",
